The log says only "Describe the CTLV transport, discovery, wire format and userspace compatibility rules", yet the document also fixes the errno contract, query fragmentation, event records, blob rules and introspection. More importantly it references :doc:`/driver-api/ctlv`, which is only added by patch 13 (d1c572829e09 "Documentation: ctlv: Describe how to write a family"). Between this patch and that one `make htmldocs` emits an unknown-document warning. Drop the reference here or reorder. Also the text documents behaviour of code that only arrives in patches 5-12.

